    "startMs": 330180,
    "endMs": 334176,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "终端升级开放六洞穴，天境仍受限；",
    "startMs": 336180,
    "endMs": 339207,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "工业体系继续建设。",
    "startMs": 339207,
    "endMs": 340684,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "相位、模块、限时封装与稳定化，构成洞穴工艺。",
    "startMs": 342180,
    "endMs": 346446,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "工业考核仍在设计，希望观察真实的工程能力。",
    "startMs": 348180,
    "endMs": 351851,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "这里是维度工序。",
    "startMs": 354180,
    "endMs": 355362,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "接下来，这个世界怎样运转，由你来设计。",
    "startMs": 355362,
